  "bun": {
    "why": "Bun 1.4.2 doesn't format .each titles: %s, %p, %j and $name stay as written, in its console output as well as its report. Bun misreads tagged-template .each tables: it runs more rows than written, with undefined values, so an assertion comparing two cells compares undefined with undefined and passes. Here the extra template rows fail (their undefined values reach a.val and an addition). Bun also passes a row that isn't an array to the callback as is, where Vitest spreads it, and gives tests no context object, so ({ expect }) => ... finds no expect.",
